---
import ButtonLink from '../ui/ButtonLink.astro';
---
<section class="bg-slate-950 px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-green-300/20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,rgba(34,197,94,0.22),transparent_36%),linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#020617)] p-8 md:p-12">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-green-300">Human-first technology</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-6xl">Automation is useful. Abandonment is not.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          We like AI, integrations, dashboards, and speed. But customers should always know there are real people behind the system, paying attention and taking responsibility.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <ButtonLink href="/contact">Talk to Barons</ButtonLink>
          <ButtonLink href="/about" variant="secondary">Why we work this way</ButtonLink>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Barons Promise</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4 text-slate-300">
          <li>Listen before we recommend.</li>
          <li>Design around the business, not vendor hype.</li>
          <li>Support the people who have to use the system.</li>
          <li>Keep improving after launch.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
